WEBVTT

00:01:12.350 --> 00:01:13.680
Metal Cannon!

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:23.550
Hundred Beast Fists!

00:02:15.610 --> 00:02:17.050
Do you want to live?

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:24.650
Even if I... took your X-Antibody...

00:02:24.650 --> 00:02:26.390
I still would not live long.

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:30.090
You have good eyes.

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:34.330
Live on my part in this new world.

00:02:36.620 --> 00:02:40.160
For the future of the Digimon...

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:49.980
Sorry for chasing you.

00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:31.090
Get out of here!

00:03:31.090 --> 00:03:33.990
You aren't a chosen one!

00:03:33.990 --> 00:03:39.430
Because a Digimon with a strange stone on the forehead like you escaped and came here,

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:41.090
this world is messed up!

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:42.560
Andromon said so!

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:44.070
Get out of this place!

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:45.570
Get out of here!

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:01.490
That's enough.

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:24.020
Why am I here?

00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:28.710
Nobody accepts me here.

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:33.740
Nobody needs me, so then...

00:04:34.490 --> 00:04:35.390
Why?

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:52.850
Is it really possible for us Royal Knights to execute Project Ark?

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:58.310
Whether it is possible or not is not our problem. That is Yggdrasil's decision.

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:01.110
We must only fulfill our duties without failure.

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:04.110
Is that fine?

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:05.620
What are you implying?

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:09.570
Aren't we just doubling the mistakes?

00:05:09.840 --> 00:05:13.140
Are you saying Yggdrasil is mistaken?

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:15.900
The start of the Digital Hazard...

00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:19.940
The X-Program that our lord, Yggdrasil, executed...

00:05:19.940 --> 00:05:21.640
For I, Dukemon, to do such...

00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:23.840
Digimon with the X-Antibody and such...

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:25.470
They must be treated as outsiders!

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:29.120
Outsiders must be removed as soon as possible.

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:35.230
They and us...

00:05:36.010 --> 00:05:39.050
As Digimon, how are we any different?

00:06:04.390 --> 00:06:08.020
Please listen to me! We don't have time to argue!

00:06:08.020 --> 00:06:10.770
At this rate, all of us Digimon will be wiped out!

00:06:11.310 --> 00:06:13.870
Don't say something like that at this kind of time!

00:06:13.870 --> 00:06:16.850
Isn't this crisis your fault in the first place?

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:21.380
That's wrong! When the X-Program was completed, many of our comrades died.

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:23.830
98% of the entire Digimon population has died.

00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:29.490
We... We had no choice but to run to this new world in order to live.

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:33.150
And you have brought your problems to this world.

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:36.140
If only you had not come...

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:39.770
If you only saved yourselves, would you feel okay about it?

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:42.450
Are you saying you don't care about other Digimon?

00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:45.330
Then what about you  guys?

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:49.650
Because you've come here, this child is in danger!

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:51.720
That is...

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:11.330
I'm sorry.

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:13.400
We really don't have the time to argue.

00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:18.480
You all came here knowing that, didn't you?

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:26.270
Everything occurred because Yggdrasil's X-Program was executed.

00:07:26.270 --> 00:07:30.100
Even this new world will be contaminated...

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:33.500
...because Yggdrasil has started hunting down Digimon with the X-Antibody.

00:07:34.210 --> 00:07:35.570
That's a lie!

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:38.340
They're going to wipe out all X-Digimon.

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:43.110
Within that, the X-Program will release itself in this world.

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:48.510
Knowing that, isn't it apparent to conclude that Yggdrasil itself is our common enemy?

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:53.760
You say some interesting things, but this is the end of it.

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:57.490
Before you arrived, I gave Yggdrasil a report.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:02.530
This is the end for you guys.

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:05.300
How could you?!

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:08.530
This meeting is over! Everyone, get out of here, quickly!

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:22.880
Run away!

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:03.120
Great Spirit!

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:18.070
Fool. They would have lived if they hadn't come!

00:09:29.720 --> 00:09:32.320
It can't be... Us as well?

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:13.940
I see.

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:17.190
You also have the X-Antibody, don't you?

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:19.120
It must have been hard for you here.

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:32.820
I have a favor to ask of you as a comrade.

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:33.870
Comrade?

00:11:33.870 --> 00:11:38.890
Yes. You noticed, right? I also have the X-Antibody.

00:11:39.850 --> 00:11:43.360
There's not much time. I will definitely return.

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:46.850
Until I come back, could you look after this guy?

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:52.080
Please protect this child.

00:12:00.850 --> 00:12:03.770
It's all right. You can surely do it.

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:05.450
Okay.

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:06.710
Thank you.

00:12:22.230 --> 00:12:26.540
That's a Royal Knight. Why is a guardian of the network...?

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:28.990
That hurts.

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:12.580
Poseidon Force!

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:40.930
How clever.

00:13:47.230 --> 00:13:50.270
Return to Yggdrasil immediately. It's an emergency!

00:14:02.720 --> 00:14:04.410
Omegamon, present!

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:07.410
Then, we will begin.

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:09.330
Golden Magnamon.

00:14:09.880 --> 00:14:15.720
Urd terminal, Skuld terminal. The resistance bases are located in those places.

00:14:15.720 --> 00:14:17.330
I've confirmed it with my own eyes.

00:14:17.610 --> 00:14:21.320
There is also one at the Versandi terminal.

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:22.990
Even in Versandi?

00:14:23.520 --> 00:14:24.550
It seems so.

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:30.000
That's what it seems. Those Digimon with the X-Antibody...

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:34.690
They believe they can evenly match up against us Royal Knights and win.

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:37.650
It depends on who makes the first move.

00:14:37.650 --> 00:14:39.220
Well said.

00:14:39.490 --> 00:14:42.070
what are you trying to say?

00:14:42.070 --> 00:14:46.730
We should take urgent action against this resistance.

00:14:46.730 --> 00:14:47.730
But...

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:52.430
Our mission is to carry out Project Ark, regardless of circumstance.

00:14:52.430 --> 00:14:54.810
Yggdrasil's decisions are absolute.

00:14:54.810 --> 00:14:56.220
There is no room to falter!

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:06.830
It's useless after all.

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:11.750
The Royal Knights... They're strong, as expected...

00:15:12.960 --> 00:15:16.160
Are they truly our enemies?

00:15:16.690 --> 00:15:21.090
Idiot! What have you been looking at all this time?

00:15:21.090 --> 00:15:25.860
The Royal Knights are just following Yggdrasil's command.

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:30.810
Those actions, I don't think they're doing them according to their own will.

00:15:30.810 --> 00:15:32.220
I don't want to think that they did.

00:15:33.680 --> 00:15:37.180
If it's as you say, that's just as bad.

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:44.740
Just because the host computer says to kill fellow Digimon,

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:48.130
the Royal Knights abide without any other thought.

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:51.290
What happened to the Royal Knights the Digimon were proud of?!

00:15:52.290 --> 00:15:53.260
That's...

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:56.080
Even so, I...

00:15:57.300 --> 00:15:59.140
I want to trust the Royal Knights!

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:02.490
Whatever Yggdrasil is trying to do...

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:06.790
Once we know that, it shouldn't be too late.

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:16.450
Are you all right?

00:16:21.970 --> 00:16:22.830
That's good.

00:16:23.820 --> 00:16:26.230
Even someone like me can help out.

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:15.770
Metal Cannon!

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:40.390
This won't do...

00:19:09.930 --> 00:19:12.800
They should know that they're no match...

00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:14.820
...but why do they keep coming at me?

00:19:17.620 --> 00:19:18.540
Why?

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:36.420
Garuru Tomahawk!

00:19:53.070 --> 00:19:53.880
Are you all right?

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:01.680
I kept... our promise...

00:20:11.420 --> 00:20:15.080
Is this... the Royal Knights' justice?!

00:20:16.230 --> 00:20:19.900
It's the justice of Yggdrasil's New Digital World!

00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:29.770
Garuru Burst!

00:21:02.250 --> 00:21:04.430
Gaia Force!

00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:16.200
Cocytus Breath!

00:21:30.650 --> 00:21:32.340
You're pretty good.

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:35.350
But, this is the end.

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:41.380
This child!

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:46.050
This child is dead!

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:48.460
Grey Sword!

00:22:25.710 --> 00:22:27.920
The X-Program was completed?

00:22:29.130 --> 00:22:32.730
Don't worry. I'll die soon.

00:22:34.000 --> 00:22:37.420
I'll give this child my X-Antibody.

00:22:41.360 --> 00:22:42.550
Do you want to live?

00:22:43.180 --> 00:22:46.440
Please, live on my part.

00:22:49.580 --> 00:22:52.780
Live on my part in this new world.

00:22:56.350 --> 00:23:00.040
Life is just that beautiful.

00:23:01.570 --> 00:23:03.750
I entrust you with this.

00:23:58.680 --> 00:24:00.450
Power Metal!

00:24:07.140 --> 00:24:08.640
Why?

00:24:08.640 --> 00:24:11.180
Why do you resist this much?

00:24:11.180 --> 00:24:12.500
Because I want to live!

00:24:15.010 --> 00:24:17.470
For me, living is enough.

00:24:17.470 --> 00:24:23.540
Just to pass on life, I want to live!

00:24:33.760 --> 00:24:36.820
Yggdrasil doesn't desire that.

00:25:02.690 --> 00:25:03.580
This lance...

00:25:04.500 --> 00:25:07.100
It's your loss, Omegamon.

00:25:08.860 --> 00:25:14.490
I'm not here to fight. I have something to ask you.

00:25:14.720 --> 00:25:18.220
Why was the X-Program executed?

00:25:18.220 --> 00:25:20.500
Do you want to know the reason behind it?

00:25:20.660 --> 00:25:22.330
Dukemon, what are you talking about?

00:25:23.170 --> 00:25:27.190
When Yggdrasil sensed the dramatic increase in the population of Digimon and the danger behind it,

00:25:27.190 --> 00:25:29.210
it decided to abandon this world.

00:25:29.640 --> 00:25:31.970
It's nothing to hide.

00:25:31.970 --> 00:25:36.970
Yes, only a certain amount of chosen Digimon would be allowed to come to this world,

00:25:36.970 --> 00:25:40.780
and only some Digimon would be allowed to advance.

00:25:40.780 --> 00:25:45.220
Project Ark... the X-Program was executed to do that?

00:25:45.770 --> 00:25:47.760
You know that name too?

00:25:49.090 --> 00:25:52.540
But, we survived.

00:25:52.540 --> 00:25:55.300
And we have made it to this world.

00:25:55.300 --> 00:26:00.100
The chosen Digimon, the surviving Digimon... aren't they all Digimon?

00:26:00.240 --> 00:26:02.170
That's wrong!

00:26:02.170 --> 00:26:04.010
You are outsiders!

00:26:04.010 --> 00:26:06.260
That is what Yggdrasil decided.

00:26:06.260 --> 00:26:09.340
Omegamon! Take a look at reality.

00:26:09.340 --> 00:26:13.100
Yggdrasil's decision already surpasses that level of perspective.

00:26:13.540 --> 00:26:14.790
What do you mean?

00:26:15.620 --> 00:26:20.200
Yggdrasil is going to initiate the second stage of Project Ark.

00:26:20.200 --> 00:26:22.650
It will destroy all Digimon.

00:26:22.860 --> 00:26:25.260
You...! That is confidential information!

00:26:25.480 --> 00:26:27.200
Does it matter?

00:26:27.200 --> 00:26:31.470
The chosen Digimon, and you Digimon with the X-Antibody...

00:26:31.470 --> 00:26:32.970
You will all be eliminated.

00:26:34.380 --> 00:26:35.790
To take it that far...

00:26:36.160 --> 00:26:39.700
Our Yggdrasil has made those orders.

00:26:39.700 --> 00:26:43.310
That was supposed to be the duty we Royal Knights should carry out.

00:26:43.820 --> 00:26:47.320
But such things... I, Dukemon, refuse!

00:26:48.550 --> 00:26:50.160
Are you saying you will betray us?

00:26:50.610 --> 00:26:58.220
If I am to not betray my own feelings, I may end up betraying Yggdrasil.

00:26:58.220 --> 00:27:00.330
I cannot help it.

00:27:01.010 --> 00:27:03.800
The next time we meet, will we be enemies?

00:27:03.800 --> 00:27:05.380
Unfortunately.

00:27:06.140 --> 00:27:13.190
My sworn friend, Omegamon, I, Dukemon, have only one more selfish thing to say.

00:27:13.190 --> 00:27:15.880
Will you listen?

00:27:16.440 --> 00:27:17.880
Try me.

00:27:17.880 --> 00:27:22.290
I would like to give them a second chance as well.

00:27:25.420 --> 00:27:27.550
I will never forget this pain.

00:27:54.660 --> 00:27:56.590
I waited for you, Dukemon.

00:27:56.950 --> 00:28:02.040
It seems we won't come to an understanding.

00:28:02.040 --> 00:28:04.170
This is farewell.

00:28:04.170 --> 00:28:08.250
I cannot overlook those who go against Yggdrasil's orders.

00:28:08.250 --> 00:28:10.700
There won't be any interference up here.

00:28:10.700 --> 00:28:11.590
Very well!

00:28:33.910 --> 00:28:34.490
You!

00:28:36.970 --> 00:28:39.680
This is the only way...

00:28:39.680 --> 00:28:42.200
...to confirm what I had in mind.

00:28:42.990 --> 00:28:45.300
Although it may be difficult...

00:29:01.510 --> 00:29:02.080
What's wrong?

00:29:04.230 --> 00:29:04.970
What's wrong?

00:29:06.180 --> 00:29:07.190
Dukemon was...

00:29:14.600 --> 00:29:16.850
You look depressed.

00:29:16.850 --> 00:29:23.200
Magnamon, have you ever felt confusion in your battles?

00:29:23.200 --> 00:29:24.410
No.

00:29:24.410 --> 00:29:26.280
Where does that confidence come from?

00:29:26.280 --> 00:29:29.650
The duty to maintain the stability of this world

00:29:29.650 --> 00:29:32.450
and the pride of the Royal Knights.

00:29:35.250 --> 00:29:37.990
I asked you a boring thing.

00:29:37.990 --> 00:29:38.990
Forget it.

00:30:03.510 --> 00:30:04.780
Tokomon?!

00:30:06.210 --> 00:30:07.320
Stay away!

00:30:08.080 --> 00:30:08.850
Tokomon...

00:30:09.560 --> 00:30:11.390
Are you DORUgamon?

00:30:13.890 --> 00:30:15.390
Don't!

00:30:17.440 --> 00:30:18.730
Disappear.

00:30:19.830 --> 00:30:21.530
Power Metal!

00:30:24.860 --> 00:30:27.260
To shoot from that position...

00:30:31.230 --> 00:30:32.340
Well, that's fine.

00:30:58.210 --> 00:31:02.490
I would like to know why you brought DORUgamon to Yggdrasil.

00:31:02.490 --> 00:31:04.520
It's Yggdrasil's will.

00:31:04.520 --> 00:31:05.600
What?

00:31:05.600 --> 00:31:08.050
I simply returned it.

00:31:10.190 --> 00:31:11.110
DORUgamon is...

00:31:11.870 --> 00:31:18.890
No, DORUmon... is not a digital life-form born of our world.

00:31:18.890 --> 00:31:22.710
He is Yggdrasil's experimental being.

00:31:22.710 --> 00:31:25.780
Those are Yggdrasil's words.

00:31:27.610 --> 00:31:29.130
For what purpose?

00:31:30.010 --> 00:31:34.820
Who knows. Yggdrasil's true intentions are unclear to me.

00:31:34.820 --> 00:31:41.950
Perhaps this means that the Royal Knights are just pawns of the majesty.

00:31:57.120 --> 00:32:02.010
Dukemon... What are your true intentions?

00:32:02.010 --> 00:32:04.020
What is it you want to confirm?

00:32:04.020 --> 00:32:08.740
Also, Yggdrasil's true intentions...

00:32:09.390 --> 00:32:13.740
There are still many things I don't know.

00:32:28.230 --> 00:32:31.140
Where's DORUgamon? Isn't he with you?

00:32:31.370 --> 00:32:34.550
Ro... Royal Knights...

00:32:35.020 --> 00:32:37.050
What happened with the Royal Knights?

00:32:43.090 --> 00:32:47.880
It's okay. No one's blaming you. It's all right.

00:32:47.880 --> 00:32:49.780
There's no need to cry.

00:33:13.660 --> 00:33:14.300
Hey!

00:33:15.470 --> 00:33:16.150
What is it?

00:33:22.010 --> 00:33:23.730
Someone I haven't seen before.

00:33:23.730 --> 00:33:27.580
Leave him alone! He's probably going for disassembly anyway.

00:33:27.810 --> 00:33:30.790
Since we found him, it can't be helped.

00:33:31.790 --> 00:33:36.290
Whether he'll live or not is up to his own will, but I won't leave him behind.

00:33:36.520 --> 00:33:38.770
Don't be sorry if it gets troublesome!

00:34:07.460 --> 00:34:09.760
I found out his identity.

00:34:12.300 --> 00:34:14.710
WarGreymon called in.

00:34:14.710 --> 00:34:18.230
He's a comrade whom the Royal Knights had kidnapped.

00:34:19.850 --> 00:34:22.470
Anyway, this one's special.

00:34:22.470 --> 00:34:23.850
He was kidnapped?

00:34:23.940 --> 00:34:26.110
That's what WarGreymon said.

00:34:28.900 --> 00:34:33.380
What do you think? Should we let him know that he's here?

00:34:34.940 --> 00:34:38.640
If WarGreymon is looking for him, we should let him know.

00:34:39.510 --> 00:34:44.410
But, then the Royal Knights might find out about this place.

00:34:44.800 --> 00:34:47.490
WarGreymon knows the risk as well.

00:34:47.930 --> 00:34:50.630
I'll trust his judgment.

00:34:51.240 --> 00:34:54.840
Even if that means putting all of your comrades here at risk?

00:34:55.010 --> 00:34:57.910
Don't forget the situation we're in right now.

00:34:59.030 --> 00:35:03.150
Everyone in the Digital World is in danger.

00:35:03.150 --> 00:35:06.560
It's not a good time to think just about one's own safety.

00:35:07.380 --> 00:35:08.560
Fine.

00:35:08.780 --> 00:35:11.800
Then, I'll inform WarGreymon.

00:35:53.000 --> 00:35:54.200
Don't worry!

00:35:54.200 --> 00:35:55.990
He'll be fine for sure.

00:35:55.990 --> 00:35:58.420
He's not the kind to die so easily.

00:35:58.420 --> 00:35:59.720
Yeah! Not so easily!

00:36:05.960 --> 00:36:07.820
We're speeding up! Hang on!

00:36:52.650 --> 00:36:53.510
Top Gun!

00:36:56.660 --> 00:36:59.780
Get away from the entrance! Run to the back!

00:37:06.830 --> 00:37:08.620
Leave him behind!

00:37:08.620 --> 00:37:12.430
I wouldn't have brought him here in the first place if I was going to abandon him.

00:37:12.430 --> 00:37:13.740
You go ahead.

00:37:13.740 --> 00:37:16.550
Get everyone to the secret platform.

00:37:16.550 --> 00:37:19.140
I'll catch up from behind.

00:37:19.410 --> 00:37:22.000
Why do you go so far for that guy?

00:37:22.340 --> 00:37:24.880
I can't let a comrade die.

00:37:25.380 --> 00:37:26.360
That's all.

00:37:28.550 --> 00:37:29.680
Don't idle around!

00:37:51.860 --> 00:37:52.550
Move it!

00:38:31.620 --> 00:38:33.070
I'll hold them off here.

00:38:33.070 --> 00:38:34.850
You guys evacuate!

00:38:34.850 --> 00:38:35.670
But...

00:38:35.670 --> 00:38:38.330
Too many are wounded. It's pointless to fight them all!

00:38:45.250 --> 00:38:48.000
I'll come to you later. Don't worry!

00:38:52.030 --> 00:38:53.310
Fall back to the platform!

00:38:53.650 --> 00:38:55.790
Help carry the injured!

00:38:56.960 --> 00:38:58.320
Cocytus Breath!

00:39:05.510 --> 00:39:06.870
I'll be waiting!

00:39:17.530 --> 00:39:21.410
For everything up to now, I'll fight with full strength!

00:39:39.580 --> 00:39:42.530
Once we go through here, we'll be safe.

00:39:42.770 --> 00:39:45.990
No need to rush. Relax.

00:39:47.560 --> 00:39:48.880
This way.

00:40:20.260 --> 00:40:23.420
There's a platform ahead that goes to a hidden road.

00:40:24.040 --> 00:40:25.020
There is?

00:41:16.910 --> 00:41:18.220
This is bad.

00:41:18.220 --> 00:41:19.780
Don't move from here until I tell you to.

00:41:22.530 --> 00:41:23.560
Do you understand?

00:41:25.030 --> 00:41:25.380
Okay.

00:41:27.600 --> 00:41:28.180
Good kid.

00:41:47.930 --> 00:41:49.320
Keep it in order!

00:41:49.630 --> 00:41:51.600
Come this way! This way!

00:42:05.870 --> 00:42:06.820
You...

00:42:07.630 --> 00:42:09.800
The least I can do is shoot one.

00:42:11.940 --> 00:42:13.400
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:42:15.420 --> 00:42:17.220
I wouldn't push myself harder than you would.

00:43:00.990 --> 00:43:01.940
It's me!

00:43:27.920 --> 00:43:29.530
If you can fight, go forward!

00:43:29.530 --> 00:43:31.150
We're going to back up WarGreymon!

00:43:43.540 --> 00:43:44.820
MetalGarurumon did...?

00:43:47.030 --> 00:43:49.590
He's taking on the enemies by himself,

00:43:49.590 --> 00:43:51.780
and he gave us the chance to escape.

00:43:53.610 --> 00:43:55.850
Please, wait for him!

00:44:31.550 --> 00:44:34.310
What's this? Did something happen at the exit?

00:44:42.340 --> 00:44:43.540
Geez, at this rate...

00:44:43.600 --> 00:44:44.220
No!

00:44:44.850 --> 00:44:46.620
I promised him!

00:44:46.620 --> 00:44:47.560
That I'd wait.

00:44:48.590 --> 00:44:49.240
But...

00:44:50.930 --> 00:44:53.770
He'll come... surely.

00:44:58.420 --> 00:44:58.950
Wait!

00:45:14.050 --> 00:45:15.430
Nice timing.

00:45:24.250 --> 00:45:25.040
Here too?!

00:45:39.530 --> 00:45:40.560
Take care of him.

00:45:44.620 --> 00:45:46.930
Thunder Cloud!

00:46:01.710 --> 00:46:03.810
Mon! He's there!

00:46:08.360 --> 00:46:08.780
Tokomon!

00:46:48.910 --> 00:46:49.930
You're alive!

00:46:50.690 --> 00:46:52.420
Sorry for worrying you.

00:47:07.690 --> 00:47:09.990
Poseidon Ball!

00:47:39.900 --> 00:47:43.100
Wake up, mon! Wake up!

00:47:47.400 --> 00:47:48.160
Tokomon...

00:48:15.170 --> 00:48:15.880
Why?

00:48:18.190 --> 00:48:19.130
For what?

00:48:25.140 --> 00:48:30.710
STOP!!!

00:48:50.500 --> 00:48:52.360
What are you?!

00:48:52.360 --> 00:48:53.340
You...

00:48:53.840 --> 00:48:55.850
We shouldn't have saved you!

00:48:56.710 --> 00:48:57.630
What do you mean?

00:49:11.400 --> 00:49:12.700
I-I'm...

00:49:22.300 --> 00:49:25.440
I'm a... Why?

00:49:29.650 --> 00:49:33.050
Is this what you mean by an experimental being?

00:49:38.730 --> 00:49:42.060
Why have I become this...

00:49:55.330 --> 00:49:55.920
I'm...

00:50:59.100 --> 00:51:00.210
The same...

00:51:07.340 --> 00:51:08.030
Mon!

00:51:20.680 --> 00:51:26.730
Everyone, think clearly! There's a reason behind him having that form!

00:51:26.730 --> 00:51:28.470
Put your hearts together!

00:51:55.350 --> 00:51:56.760
So, that's how it is.

00:51:59.610 --> 00:52:02.420
Yggdrasil has already predicted this outcome.

00:52:03.560 --> 00:52:09.880
At that time we Royal Knights falter with Project Ark,

00:52:10.510 --> 00:52:11.800
this method was to be implemented.

00:52:13.550 --> 00:52:15.630
So it has been thought that something went wrong.

00:52:16.560 --> 00:52:17.940
Dukemon was an example.

00:52:18.230 --> 00:52:20.070
You'll comply to that?

00:52:20.070 --> 00:52:22.010
I must confirm Yggdrasil's decision!

00:52:22.720 --> 00:52:24.320
Wait, Omegamon!

00:52:41.170 --> 00:52:42.840
Final Elysian!

00:53:01.200 --> 00:53:05.950
I, Dukemon, have returned from the data space.

00:53:13.920 --> 00:53:19.570
WarGreymon, MetalGarurumon, all of you withdraw from here!

00:53:22.930 --> 00:53:25.940
DORUgremon and I will handle this!

00:53:30.680 --> 00:53:31.280
Let's go!

00:53:33.970 --> 00:53:35.220
Got it!

00:53:35.220 --> 00:53:37.190
Those who can fly, help the ones who can't!

00:53:37.860 --> 00:53:40.550
Everyone get past the cliff and enter the forest!

00:53:41.990 --> 00:53:43.700
I'll be all right.

00:53:43.700 --> 00:53:44.580
You go somewhere safe.

00:53:47.890 --> 00:53:48.830
Mon!

00:53:49.780 --> 00:53:52.130
I'll come as soon as I can, I promise.

00:53:53.860 --> 00:53:55.940
I'll leave the rest to you.

00:53:59.780 --> 00:54:02.360
Royal Saber!

00:54:23.400 --> 00:54:24.350
You're all right!

00:54:27.930 --> 00:54:29.280
I made you worry, eh?

00:54:30.380 --> 00:54:31.160
I...

00:54:34.750 --> 00:54:36.570
Is it okay for me to be alive?

00:54:37.780 --> 00:54:42.330
If I had died, these things wouldn't have happened!

00:54:44.590 --> 00:54:48.850
I, Dukemon, wanted to know the answer to that.

00:54:50.170 --> 00:54:55.470
Just what am I? Why am I here?

00:54:56.450 --> 00:54:59.580
Everything has the will to live.

00:54:59.580 --> 00:55:04.900
From the first time life existed, that much has not changed.

00:55:12.280 --> 00:55:12.660
DORUgremon!

00:55:14.420 --> 00:55:15.490
Go to Yggdrasil!

00:55:18.400 --> 00:55:21.190
You want to find out your identity, right?

00:55:42.810 --> 00:55:45.230
All of the answers are there.

00:55:45.230 --> 00:55:51.270
What has happened to Yggdrasil, even I, Dukemon, truthfully do not know.

00:55:51.270 --> 00:55:54.040
But, there is no other path except that!

00:55:54.880 --> 00:55:55.750
But...

00:55:57.980 --> 00:56:00.400
I, Dukemon, can handle this place on my own.

00:56:01.420 --> 00:56:05.220
You must go to my lord, Yggdrasil.

00:56:05.220 --> 00:56:10.110
That is the answer that I, Dukemon, gained from perishing once.

00:56:16.910 --> 00:56:17.500
I'll go.

00:56:51.050 --> 00:56:53.280
It's useless, Omegamon!

00:56:53.280 --> 00:56:55.160
No one can reach Yggdrasil!

00:56:56.910 --> 00:56:59.910
It's problematic if it's unreachable.

00:56:59.910 --> 00:57:08.470
I pledged my royalty to Yggdrasil, but even so, I can't tolerate the majesty's selfishness.

00:57:09.300 --> 00:57:11.820
Selfishness? How dare you say that!

00:57:14.570 --> 00:57:16.860
Then what is this chaos?!

00:57:19.070 --> 00:57:20.290
That is...

00:57:31.290 --> 00:57:33.000
Why are you here?

00:57:33.870 --> 00:57:37.470
This is not a place for one like you.

00:57:37.780 --> 00:57:39.470
Leave this place at once!

00:57:40.570 --> 00:57:44.210
Dukemon opened the path for me.

00:57:44.860 --> 00:57:45.810
Dukemon?

00:57:47.900 --> 00:57:49.480
I came here to find an answer.

00:57:50.780 --> 00:57:52.280
I want to meet Yggdrasil!

00:57:53.370 --> 00:57:54.320
There is nothing to ask.

00:57:54.970 --> 00:57:56.350
Hmph. Interesting.

00:57:58.540 --> 00:57:58.890
It can't be!

00:58:00.220 --> 00:58:06.320
Even the Royal Knights can't meet Yggdrasil, but this guy wants to meet it.

00:58:06.320 --> 00:58:12.380
Also, the one who showed him the way was none other than our sworn friend, Dukemon.

00:58:12.380 --> 00:58:15.080
Then, we should answer to that.

00:58:17.250 --> 00:58:21.510
If you defeat me, then that wish can be granted.

00:58:23.250 --> 00:58:24.820
D-Defeat you, but that's...

00:58:36.440 --> 00:58:39.990
Why is there a need to get so emotional?

00:58:39.990 --> 00:58:43.900
Even though he is Yggdrasil's test object,

00:58:43.900 --> 00:58:46.640
isn't he just another digital life-form?

00:58:47.190 --> 00:58:52.360
No. What he and I are thinking are probably similar.

00:58:53.880 --> 00:59:02.020
In that case, whoever reaches Yggdrasil and learns its true intentions... That will be enough.

00:59:02.020 --> 00:59:06.180
That fact that Dukemon opened the path for you has further meaning.

00:59:06.180 --> 00:59:07.860
Show me your true self!

00:59:10.110 --> 00:59:11.530
Wait.

00:59:11.530 --> 00:59:13.580
There's not enough time!

00:59:13.580 --> 00:59:16.630
If we don't hurry, the Digital World will...

00:59:17.710 --> 00:59:22.210
If you meet Yggdrasil and have your questions answered,

00:59:22.750 --> 00:59:25.140
can the Digital World be saved?!

00:59:32.510 --> 00:59:34.300
How conceited!

00:59:34.300 --> 00:59:39.060
You can't even face me on equal terms. What can you do by meeting Yggdrasil?

00:59:40.480 --> 00:59:43.610
No. I don't want to fight.

00:59:44.710 --> 00:59:47.100
I have no reason to fight you!

00:59:47.710 --> 00:59:50.830
Even if you don't have one, I do over here.

00:59:51.730 --> 00:59:54.580
For what did you come all this way?

00:59:55.620 --> 00:59:58.390
The existence of everything!

00:59:59.730 --> 01:00:01.820
Then fight.

01:00:01.820 --> 01:00:05.150
Defend that resolve with more than your words.

01:00:06.020 --> 01:00:09.320
Prove to me that you're fighting for the existence of everything!

01:00:28.220 --> 01:00:31.270
You aren't the one I should fight!

01:00:32.960 --> 01:00:34.200
You're still saying that?

01:00:34.200 --> 01:00:35.810
Then who is your opponent?

01:00:37.970 --> 01:00:40.900
I'll find out when I meet Yggdrasil.

01:00:42.300 --> 01:00:45.920
Why are you hesitating? Invaders must be eliminated.

01:00:46.280 --> 01:00:48.290
If I must, I will assist you!

01:00:51.920 --> 01:00:55.400
The Royal Knights protect the order of the Digital World.

01:00:56.250 --> 01:01:01.370
For you to meet Yggdrasil would be to violate this order.

01:01:12.050 --> 01:01:13.450
This is the end.

01:01:18.330 --> 01:01:21.430
Live on my part in this new world.

01:01:21.700 --> 01:01:24.900
Please, live on my part.

01:01:25.330 --> 01:01:28.900
For the future of the Digimon...

01:01:29.220 --> 01:01:31.940
Life is just that beautiful.

01:01:32.680 --> 01:01:36.030
You must go to my lord, Yggdrasil.

01:01:36.490 --> 01:01:42.850
That is the answer that I, Dukemon, gained from perishing once.

01:02:08.460 --> 01:02:09.530
Go!

01:03:11.050 --> 01:03:12.190
You're...

01:03:12.680 --> 01:03:13.300
It can't be...!

01:03:14.840 --> 01:03:16.840
I am Alphamon.

01:03:17.950 --> 01:03:19.730
That's impossible!

01:03:20.350 --> 01:03:25.650
Alphamon was acknowledged, but he was said to never actually exist!

01:03:25.650 --> 01:03:28.590
A Royal Knight of myth!

01:03:29.100 --> 01:03:32.910
But, I exist here.

01:03:32.910 --> 01:03:36.830
Thanks to you, I understand what I must do.

01:03:37.630 --> 01:03:43.530
I cannot forgive Yggdrasil's interventions any longer.

01:03:45.300 --> 01:03:49.830
Dukemon sent you here for this purpose?

01:03:51.910 --> 01:03:52.820
We'll confirm it.

01:03:54.030 --> 01:03:57.900
I accept your intent. Please accompany me.

01:04:03.150 --> 01:04:07.340
Stop! The Royal Knights must protect the order of the Digital World!

01:04:07.340 --> 01:04:09.860
Isn't that what you always said not so long ago?

01:04:09.860 --> 01:04:11.220
Is this order?!

01:04:11.790 --> 01:04:14.800
It seems you have yet to realize.

01:04:14.800 --> 01:04:18.720
When the order of the Digital World begins to collapse,

01:04:18.720 --> 01:04:22.560
stubbornly following Yggdrasil's order is not the only way.

01:04:23.270 --> 01:04:28.290
The Royal Knights never move unless told, yet you'll disregard that and still go?

01:04:28.800 --> 01:04:33.400
We'll go. Our sworn friend, Dukemon, would have done so.

01:04:35.590 --> 01:04:37.050
Is it a problem?

01:04:37.580 --> 01:04:39.870
Our comrades are in trouble.

01:04:39.870 --> 01:04:42.890
When Digimon are in need of other Digimon,

01:04:42.890 --> 01:04:45.960
why do we have to argue and fight against each other?

01:05:12.930 --> 01:05:14.040
That's not it.

01:05:15.370 --> 01:05:18.670
Order is necessary for  troubled times like this.

01:05:27.570 --> 01:05:30.070
Warning

01:06:15.190 --> 01:06:16.320
Who are you?!

01:06:19.300 --> 01:06:20.070
This is...

01:06:50.620 --> 01:06:53.360
Digitalize of Soul!

01:07:08.230 --> 01:07:08.770
Let's go.

01:07:56.070 --> 01:07:58.240
This is Yggdrasil?

01:08:00.220 --> 01:08:01.930
We've come to see Yggdrasil.

01:08:02.600 --> 01:08:05.330
Where do your true intentions lie?

01:08:05.330 --> 01:08:06.930
What are your trying to accomplish?

01:08:07.800 --> 01:08:09.990
I wish to know as well.

01:08:09.990 --> 01:08:16.940
Why did we have to execute Project Ark with such overwhelming force?

01:08:20.820 --> 01:08:24.400
Yggdrasil, if you remain silent,

01:08:24.400 --> 01:08:26.250
are you prepared for the consequences?

01:08:32.280 --> 01:08:35.430
Either way, we have no safe way of return.

01:08:37.510 --> 01:08:41.880
Magnamon has already warned Yggdrasil of our coming.

01:08:41.880 --> 01:08:44.490
We are the traitors.

01:09:11.260 --> 01:09:16.130
If Yggdrasil remains silent, can we resolve this problem?

01:09:17.730 --> 01:09:19.670
We might not be able to.

01:09:21.690 --> 01:09:25.220
Then, what are we doing here?

01:09:25.220 --> 01:09:26.970
I'm certain about one thing.

01:09:28.570 --> 01:09:32.730
No matter what we do, the Digital World will collapse at this rate.

01:09:48.410 --> 01:09:49.440
Then...

01:09:50.110 --> 01:09:51.630
We can't let it happen.

01:10:56.770 --> 01:10:58.850
Ultimate War Blade King Dragon Sword!

01:11:37.880 --> 01:11:39.280
So that's how it is.

01:11:58.400 --> 01:11:59.400
What have you done?!

01:12:01.230 --> 01:12:04.630
I entrust this to you.

01:12:05.040 --> 01:12:07.040
No, but...

01:12:08.010 --> 01:12:10.410
He is my shadow.

01:12:13.300 --> 01:12:18.920
If not for my comrades, I wouldn't have obtained this form.

01:12:18.920 --> 01:12:21.990
I might have ended up like him.

01:12:21.990 --> 01:12:28.490
But, I am proud to have met you all in this Digital World.

01:12:29.670 --> 01:12:33.360
Because life is... to be passed on...

01:13:04.540 --> 01:13:06.140
Yggdrasil!

01:13:07.280 --> 01:13:10.100
Is this your wish?

01:13:13.480 --> 01:13:15.780
Even I do not understand.

01:13:15.780 --> 01:13:17.120
There is nothing more to understand!

01:13:24.000 --> 01:13:28.180
All Delete!

01:14:15.090 --> 01:14:18.250
That's as far as I remember.

01:14:18.250 --> 01:14:21.380
So, Yggdrasil was desperate.

01:14:23.230 --> 01:14:27.860
I finally understand the true intention behind Project Ark.

01:14:28.820 --> 01:14:29.850
I'm listening.

01:14:30.640 --> 01:14:36.540
Our lord, Yggdrasil, tried to intervene in this world.

01:14:36.920 --> 01:14:42.180
However, the world grew too complex for it.

01:14:42.930 --> 01:14:47.570
That's when it thought it could change it by restarting everything.

01:14:48.160 --> 01:14:50.350
So, that is Project Ark?

01:14:50.660 --> 01:14:52.110
So it seems.

01:14:53.010 --> 01:14:59.940
However, our lord didn't have the power to carry it out by itself.

01:15:01.050 --> 01:15:05.880
That is why I think it relied on that test subject for everything.

01:15:05.880 --> 01:15:10.720
In the end, we were dancing pawns on Yggdrasil's hands...

01:15:10.720 --> 01:15:15.750
As I said, Yggdrasil was desperate.

01:15:15.750 --> 01:15:19.540
Likely, like you, it only wanted to live.

01:15:19.540 --> 01:15:23.870
Everything has a will to live, eh?

01:15:24.850 --> 01:15:29.510
I look forward to their future...

01:15:55.670 --> 01:15:56.910
I was looking for you!
